{
  "id": "group-vo-01",
  "clips": [
    {
      "name": "01",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "小组作业总有人划水，可能也包括你。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "01.mp3",
      "bytes": 58557,
      "heard": "小组作业总有人滑水可能也包括你",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "name": "02",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "只要以为身后有几个人帮你，你就会少出百分之十五的力。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "02.mp3",
      "bytes": 79037,
      "heard": "只要以為身後有幾個人幫你你就會賞出15%的利",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.88
    },
    {
      "name": "03",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一九七四年，心理学家让人拉绳子测力气。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "03.mp3",
      "bytes": 69006,
      "heard": "1974年 心理學家讓人拉繩子測歷期",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 4.24
    },
    {
      "name": "04",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "两个人一起拉，每人只出百分之九十一；",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "04.mp3",
      "bytes": 58557,
      "heard": "两个人一起拉,每人只出91%",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "name": "05",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "三个人，百分之八十二；六个人，只剩百分之七十八。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "05.mp3",
      "bytes": 76529,
      "heard": "3個人 82% 6個人只剩 78%",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.992,
      "seconds": 4.72
    },
    {
      "name": "06",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你可能会说：人一多，节奏对不齐嘛。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "06.mp3",
      "bytes": 63990,
      "heard": "你可能會說人一多節奏對不起嘛",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.92
    },
    {
      "name": "07",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "于是他们蒙上你的眼睛，告诉你身后还有人一起拉。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "07.mp3",
      "bytes": 76529,
      "heard": "於是他們蒙上你的眼睛告訴你身後還有人一起啦",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 4.72
    },
    {
      "name": "08",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "其实绳子上，只有你一个人在用力。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "08.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "其实绳子上只有你一个人在用力",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "09",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "以为有一个帮手，你出百分之九十；以为有两到六个，只剩百分之八十五。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "09.mp3",
      "bytes": 102025,
      "heard": "以為有一個幫手,你出90%以為有2到6個,只剩85%",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 6.32
    },
    {
      "name": "10",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "没人跟你抢节奏，少的这百分之十五，是你自己松的劲。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "10.mp3",
      "bytes": 77783,
      "heard": "沒人給你搶節奏少著這15%是你自己鬆得盡",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 4.8
    },
    {
      "name": "11",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "因为人一多，就没人看得见你出了多少力。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "11.mp3",
      "bytes": 58557,
      "heard": "因为人一多就没人看得见你出了多少例",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "name": "12",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "七十八项研究放在一起看，结论都一样：",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "12.mp3",
      "bytes": 59811,
      "heard": "78項研究放在一起看,結論都一樣",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.68
    },
    {
      "name": "13",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "只要每个人那份能被单独看见，划水几乎就消失了。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "13.mp3",
      "bytes": 80291,
      "heard": "只要每个人那份能被单独看见滑水几乎就消失了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 4.96
    },
    {
      "name": "14",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "所以分工别写“大家一起做”，写清楚谁做哪一块。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "14.mp3",
      "bytes": 76529,
      "heard": "所以分工別寫大家一起做寫清楚誰做哪一塊",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.72
    },
    {
      "name": "15",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "发到你的小组作业群，看看谁先回。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "15.mp3",
      "bytes": 47272,
      "heard": "發到你的小組作業群看看誰先回",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.88
    }
  ],
